    <string name="steps_title">How to set the watch</string>
    <string name="steps">1. Confirm the status is not red.\n2. Plug in wired headphones. Bluetooth does not work.\n3. Tap Max volume and confirm the output is this headphone.\n4. Tap Start. 13.7 kHz is hard to hear, but it is still transmitting.\n5. Hold the speaker against the back of the watch.\n6. Start a forced receive and keep it there for 3 to 8 minutes.\n7. If it fails, change the carrier or waveform, turn on Invert, or move the trim by 20 ms.</string>
